<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 24,120 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 24,120 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 24.120 on Minsk's Interbank Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 23.920 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					   March 19	    March 18</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar	  24.120		23.920</p>
<p> Volume traded			 $4.650 million	  $4.120 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38 044-229-2264</p>
